<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal rejects bids to drain market funds.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal rejects bids to drain market funds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it rejected bids at its offer to drain money market funds with four- and nine-week operations.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
